А. Прочитай словосочетания и реши, какие из них могут относиться только к летним каникулам, а какие к любому времени года.
get up late in the morning;
enjoy the beauty of the countryside;
swim in the river, lake, sea or ocean;
play my favourite games every day;
meet my friends every day;
go travelling with my family;
visit interesting places;
read a lot of books;
eat a lot of fruit.

tasks.solution:
А.
Летние каникулы: swim in the river, lake, sea or ocean; eat a lot of fruit; play my favourite games every day.
В любое время года: meet my friends every day; go travelling with my family; visit interesting places; read a lot of books; get up late in the morning; enjoy the beauty of the countryside.
Б.
Last summer I was able to swim in the river, eat a lot of fruit, and meet with my friends.
